name schooldocs
category Package
revision 61719
shortdesc Various layout styles for school documents
longdesc The purpose of this package is to provide several layout styles
longdesc for school documents. It is useful for exercise sheets, exams,
longdesc course materials. The package sets the page geometry
longdesc (dimensions of text and margins) and the title typesetting; the
longdesc various styles define the header, footer and title formatting.
longdesc Many features are freely configurable.
